{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1850","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. To My Critics"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Suneet has three digits $$$a$$$, $$$b$$$, and $$$c$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Since math isn't his strongest point, he asks you to determine if you can choose any two digits to make a sum greater or equal to $$$10$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" if there is such a pair, and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" otherwise."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\leq t \\leq 1000$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only line of each test case contains three digits $$$a$$$, $$$b$$$, $$$c$$$ ($$$0 \\leq a, b, c \\leq 9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" if such a pair exists, and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" otherwise."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can output the answer in any case (for example, the strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yEs"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" will be recognized as a positive answer)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n8 1 2\n4 4 5\n9 9 9\n0 0 0\n8 5 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYES\nNO\nYES\nNO\nYES\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the first test case, by choosing the digits $$$8$$$ and $$$2$$$ we can obtain a sum of $$$8 + 2 = 10$$$ which satisfies the condition, thus the output should be \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the second test case, any combination of chosen digits won't be at least $$$10$$$, thus the output should be \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (note that we can not choose the digit on the same position twice)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the third test case, any combination of chosen digits will have a sum equal to $$$18$$$, thus the output should be \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1850A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1850/problem/A"}